WEBVTT

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.490
<i>The months that pass within my dreams</i>

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair</i>

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:29.670
<i>If I turn around, the stories of the 
past would appear before my eyes</i>

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.130
<i>In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world</i>

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.010
<i>Shangri-la is nowhere to be found</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.810
<i>No one knows the love of the spring wind</i>

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:54.030
<i>The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over</i>

00:00:54.610 --> 00:01:01.990
<i>Trading places, they bloom then wilt</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.830
<i>In January, I pick a flower with no petals</i>

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:13.170
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>In March, the peach blossoms bloom</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.690
<i>In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming</i>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.780
<i>In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis</i>

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>18:               Impaction</b>

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:49.990
Rikukin-sama, what kind 
of kung fu is he using?

00:01:47.500 --> 00:02:01.600
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:56.250
It's the power of his rosary 
that's blocking your Suizourai.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.070
En Tou is a Zensei enchanter.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:06.500
The various legendary weapons were 
mostly created by enchanters.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.270
But both people and weapons 
have their limits.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.490
Show us what you can do.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.070
You shouldn't underestimate me.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.750
He's fast.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:35.730
A smoke screen.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.080
<i>In that case...</i>

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.380
<i>Finish him in a single blow!</i>

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.230
<i>He had more than one wall?!</i>

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:02.650
I commend you on breaking Chifunju's wall.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.650
But now...

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.310
You're finished!

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.670
Damn you, Rikukin.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.870
When did you learn to use Goriki Shifu?

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:29.070
Rikukin-sama, thank you.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.730
No need to thank me.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:34.560
I'm surprised En Tou has improved 
his skills this much, though.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.260
Reigyoku, you did well.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:39.370
Now stand back.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:42.370
I'll handle the rest.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:45.780
Wha—

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.160
This is the shouitsu style's Gorai Fujuu?

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:55.750
Enchanters pour their entire 
hearts into their weapons.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.250
There's only one way to destroy them:

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:02.500
by overwhelming them with your strength.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.040
Crap!

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.800
Wh-Whoa!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.750
Impressive.

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.600
Is that all?

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.390
The jousei style's Goriki Shifu.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.250
The shouitsu style's Gorai Fujuu.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.960
You keep using techniques from other styles.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:36.380
Don't you have any pride as the last 
remaining survivor of the Sanichimon?

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.590
Sanichimon?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:44.730
That sect was dissolved a long time ago.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:48.050
It's been years since
I last heard that name.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:52.970
<i>Is this an effect of the ki 
overflowing from Rikukin-sama?</i>

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.400
<i>Even his appearance has changed.</i>

00:04:56.990 --> 00:05:00.620
<i>The ki surrounding his body is 
different from his usual ki, too.</i>

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.680
You have no right to lecture me on pride.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:14.630
I never thought I'd see the Sanichimon's 
secret art again at my age!

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.120
Take this!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.460
Yazuju!

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:30.500
Huh?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:32.960
My Chifunju!

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:38.140
You fool. Surely you have 
other defensive orbs.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.850
<i>Why is his blood that color?</i>

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:46.030
<i>His wound is closing.</i>

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.550
<i>What secret art is this?</i>

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:53.660
Reigyoku the shinjin, you're a lucky man.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:58.020
It's not often you get to see my weapon

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:01.510
or the Gyakusei Sanjuu 
that Rikukin-senpai's using.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:08.470
When a person is born, their innate 
ki materializes to form their body.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.160
However, the core principle 
of Sanichimon is returning

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:17.020
to that innate ki that is 
the origin of all things.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.520
If you master Gyakusei Sanjuu

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.870
and completely return 
your ki to its innate state,

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:25.730
you could even become 
a legendary wizard.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.060
Konsenfu!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.540
<i>I can't move!</i>

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.410
Kan Tan!

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:34.590
Coming.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:35.980
Bang, bang, bang!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.560
Suizourai!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.960
Kan Tan! Use your hammer!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.300
Okay.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:55.680
Reigyoku, don't attack them.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.510
It's not that I underestimate 
your abilities.

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:05.010
Rather, it's your first time fighting an 
enchanter. You're at a disadvantage.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:09.890
If I hadn't been here, you would've been 
killed in your fight against En Tou earlier.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:13.700
But that giant isn't an enchanter, is he?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.410
No, the big guy is an enchanter, as well.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.850
Are we lucky or unlucky?

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:24.890
Enchanters are rare enough these days, 
but we've met two in just one day.

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:27.350
Rather skilled ones at that.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.590
Impressive, Rikukin-senpai.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.770
How did you know Kan Tan is an enchanter?

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:40.120
I knew the moment I saw 
that nonsensical water gun.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:45.590
And that he's much stronger than you.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:49.400
I know how strong you are, En Tou.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:55.170
Creating those ridiculous orbs must have 
consumed a lifetime's worth of ki.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.300
There's no such thing as an enchanter

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.560
who doesn't love the weapon they 
created as if it were their child.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:09.040
I've seen enchanters end their own lives 
when their weapons were destroyed.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:15.690
But when your Chifunju was destroyed, 
you hardly reacted at all.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:21.390
You responded that way because you 
could easily acquire another weapon.

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:26.130
That big guy is probably 
providing you with them.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:31.570
So you've actually learned 
something in your old age.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.720
You've got a good eye.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:36.320
But you've got one thing wrong.

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:42.510
My masterpiece is Kan Tan, not those orbs.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:43.770
What?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.120
Hurry up and produce your Rabbit!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:48.490
Huh? Oh.

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:50.660
Hoppy Hoppy Rabbit!

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.280
We're not playing anymore?

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.110
You idiot!

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.080
At this rate, we'll be killed!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.330
You can't escape!

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.890
Hoppy Hoppy Rabbit!

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:00.990
Hop!

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.150
Th-They're fast.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.250
Taiin Chouju!

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:08.480
After them!

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.020
<i>Why does my body feel so light?</i>

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:14.250
<i>I've never seen a technique like this.</i>

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.950
<i>Rikukin-sama and this En Tou fellow...</i>

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:23.210
<i>Is this the power of outsiders 
who survived the Koushin War?</i>

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.840
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:29.980
We've got Rikukin and Chou 
Reigyoku following us.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:33.970
All we needed to do was steal the 
Tsuutenroku, but it can't be helped now.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.830
Send everyone waiting at 
the foot of the mountain.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:39.630
The bigger the commotion, the better.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:44.380
Now they won't realize what we're after.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.890
<i>Damn, she's quick.</i>

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:05.990
<i>This time I'll get her.</i>

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.080
<i>A p-pebble?</i>

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:33.360
<i>There's no point in hiding behind a tree.</i>

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:37.950
<i>Wha...</i>

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:39.730
<i>She's not there?</i>

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:40.960
Watch out!

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:41.690
Huh?

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:42.660
Damn!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.200
No way...

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.410
<i>I lost her.</i>

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:52.150
<i>Where? Where is she?</i>

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:55.410
<i>Oh, come on! What is this?</i>

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.950
<i>We were trying to sneak attack her,</i>

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.580
<i>so why does it feel like 
we're being sneak attacked?</i>

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.680
<i>Sheesh. Amateurs.</i>

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.740
<i>Can't they ambush someone any better?</i>

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:26.340
<i>If this girl's a higher priority than the 
Tsuutenroku, she must be strong.</i>

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.860
<i>I'm the only one who can take her down.</i>

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.930
<i>I'll wait for her to let her guard down,</i>

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.130
<i>then finish her with a single blow.</i>

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.360
Wha—

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:47.720
Listen closely, Houhou.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:52.630
You can safely assume anyone who's about 
to attack you and Soran is an enemy.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.740
Beat every last one of them.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:56.670
We don't know what will happen.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.010
Be careful.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.580
Beat every last one of them.

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:13.320
I'm exhausted.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.810
She's a quick girl.

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.870
She nearly caught me 
before I could trap her.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.490
I'll probably be fired now.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.930
<i>No way.</i>

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.610
<i>She got Go?</i>

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.990
<i>Which means the others were all...</i>

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:47.870
Uh... Fancy meeting you here, Hou-nee.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.700
H-Hey, Hou-nee. Where are you going?

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.440
I'm going back

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.410
to Chou Soran.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.590
<i>How did she know?</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.890
I told you, Yokugadoku.

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:14.170
Changing your appearance doesn't 
work against true masters.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.290
With enough training,

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:21.940
instead of just seeing someone's 
appearance when you look at them,

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:25.740
you can also see the ki inside their body.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:30.690
Even if you can take on 
Chou Soran's appearance,

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:35.450
you can't simulate his ki.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.610
But I'm impressed, girl.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:44.680
Your movements and ki are 
like a legendary wizard's.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:07.190
She dislocated her joints 
to escape from my grasp.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.600
She's so calm, she's completely 
unaffected by powerful attacks.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.950
Her movements are precise and efficient.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:19.550
She's a well-trained soldier.

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:22.500
No, no.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:25.670
Didn't I just tell you?

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.750
This is why I don't like outsiders.

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:33.300
It should be clear from looking 
at your defeated allies.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:37.250
She didn't train for her strength.

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.680
She was born with it.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.060
It's instinctive.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.550
Really? Let's make a bet.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.450
If I win, I'll take that 
liquor you love so much.

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.850
Fine.

00:14:53.850 --> 00:15:00.590
If I win, I'll take the fancy 
whiskey you've been hiding.

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:15.720
What's wrong? Are you done running?

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:22.850
Are you sure you should be following 
us so far, Rikukin-senpai?

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:28.200
Those kids you employ 
could be dying right now.

00:15:29.230 --> 00:15:30.840
Don't worry about them.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.490
I know how strong they are.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:42.490
How many men do you think we brought?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.380
Kill them!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.970
Today's the day we bring down the Tenshifu!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.180
Do whatever it takes to stop them!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.280
What are these guys after?

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:25.290
What are we after?

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:32.250
I don't know about the other guys, but I love 
breaking things that belong to others.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:37.600
Nothing beats the moment you destroy 
something someone desperately defended.

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:42.050
This old building must have 
a long history, right?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.470
Bastard!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.750
This'll be worth destroying.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.570
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:02.660
It's the Express Delivery Company!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.710
Don't let them escape!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.070
Express Delivery shrimps!

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:09.410
I'll take you all on!

00:17:12.150 --> 00:17:14.620
Jo San, how are things over there?

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:17.110
Things are pretty bad.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:20.040
It's not just the guys who 
infiltrated the mountain.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.920
They've met up with the 
guys who were at the base.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:28.050
And I see a lot of faces that 
aren't in our database.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:33.330
<i>Looks like Zensei has gathered a lot 
of members in the past few years.</i>

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.490
Damn.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:39.130
We brought a bunch of guys too, 
but we can just barely handle them.

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.520
<i>We should contact Houhou immediately.</i>

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.650
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.310
She's not answering?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:55.680
You guys stay here.

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:57.220
Keep your guard up.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:57.960
Yes, sir.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:01.940
<i>I can't believe we were wrong.</i>

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:04.210
<i>If they're not after the Tsuutenroku,</i>

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.990
<i>then what are they after?</i>

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:11.430
<i>Damn. Why do I have this bad feeling?</i>

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:24.230
Jo San-san, what's going on?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:28.660
Was there a girl standing 
in front of that door?

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.040
Fuu Houhou, the girl who was with us.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.430
Fuu Houhou?

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:38.210
She wasn't here when we got here.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.700
Jo Yon, send people this way immediately.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.090
Houhou is missing.

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:46.910
Damn.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:51.400
Go inside and explain the 
situation to the Tenshi.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:53.020
Hold on.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.030
What do you think you're doing?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.860
Are you Zensei spies?

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:02.000
Don't get the wrong idea, Jo San-san.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:06.030
Do you not see the golden light 
coming through the windows?

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:12.080
The Tenshi must be doing something 
inside to produce this much light.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.730
And this is no small disturbance.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.160
The Tenshi must have noticed.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:25.730
In other words, whatever the Tenshi 
is doing right now is more important.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:31.200
I'm sorry, but we can't let you 
go inside and interrupt him.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:57.040
Master, did it work this time?

00:19:57.520 --> 00:20:00.650
No, it failed again.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.640
That's the third time.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.470
What's going on?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.140
I don't think I did anything wrong.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.970
If there's a problem, it must be you, Soran.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:21.640
If you're hesitant or resistant to 
accepting the way of the Tenshi,

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.510
you can't receive it.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:25.490
I thought I told you.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:30.120
Do you not want to become the Tenshi?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.660
Master...

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:37.290
If you're concerned you'll 
have to give up your old life

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:40.960
once you become the Tenshi, don't worry.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:44.730
The Tenshifu's rules aren't so strict.

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:48.040
You can even get married or have children.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:52.180
Meat, alcohol, and tobacco 
aren't prohibited, either.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:56.190
As long as you're on the right path,

00:20:56.190 --> 00:21:02.110
rules that require you to give up your 
desires are meaningless to the shouitsu style.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.630
If the day-to-day business of the 
Tenshifu doesn't interest you,

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:09.150
you can let Reigyoku or 
the others handle it.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:14.670
What's important is that once 
you become the Tenshi,

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:19.640
no one will be able to touch you.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:24.290
Excluding criminals like Zensei, of course.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:29.670
You must know that this Raten 
Taishou was held for you.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.900
Why would you have any hesitation now?

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.000
Master...

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:43.140
If you really want me to become the 
Tenshi, I want you to answer one thing.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:47.290
My question has nothing to 
do with the Koushin War.

